# FlowTree — Sprints — módulo `tasks`

@host = http://localhost:5100/api
@token = COLE_O_TOKEN_AQUI
@projectUuid = COLE_O_UUID_DO_PROJETO
@sprintUuid = COLE_O_UUID_DA_SPRINT

### Listar sprints (cards_count, done_count)
GET {{host}}/projects/{{projectUuid}}/sprints
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Criar sprint (nasce como planned)
POST {{host}}/projects/{{projectUuid}}/sprints
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Sprint 3",
  "goal": "Fechar o módulo de relatórios.",
  "starts_at": "2026-09-15",
  "ends_at": "2026-09-26"
}

### Atualizar sprint
PUT {{host}}/sprints/{{sprintUuid}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Sprint 3 — Relatórios",
  "goal": "Fechar o módulo de relatórios e o export.",
  "ends_at": "2026-09-30"
}

### Ativar sprint (só uma ativa por projeto)
POST {{host}}/sprints/{{sprintUuid}}/activate
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Concluir sprint — cards abertos voltam ao Backlog
POST {{host}}/sprints/{{sprintUuid}}/complete
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "move_open_to": "backlog"
}

### Concluir sprint — cards abertos vão para outra sprint
POST {{host}}/sprints/{{sprintUuid}}/complete
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "move_open_to": "COLE_O_UUID_DA_PROXIMA_SPRINT"
}

### Concluir sprint — cards abertos permanecem nela
POST {{host}}/sprints/{{sprintUuid}}/complete
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "move_open_to": null
}

### Reabrir sprint concluída (volta para planned)
POST {{host}}/sprints/{{sprintUuid}}/reopen
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Atribuir todo o Backlog à sprint
POST {{host}}/sprints/{{sprintUuid}}/assign-backlog
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Exportar CSV da sprint
GET {{host}}/sprints/{{sprintUuid}}/export
Accept: text/csv
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reordenar sprints
PATCH {{host}}/projects/{{projectUuid}}/sprints/reorder
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "sprint_uuids": [
    "UUID_SPRINT_2",
    "UUID_SPRINT_1"
  ]
}

### Excluir sprint (cards voltam ao Backlog)
DELETE {{host}}/sprints/{{sprintUuid}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
